OL,3,GNEWSAKing Charles says he's 'privileged
OL,4,Aand proud' to have special connection
OL,5,Awith Wales at opening of Senedd
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles III and Queen Camilla are
OL,8,Fin Cardiff to officially open the new
OL,9,Fterm of the Senedd, Wales' parliament
OL,11,FThe King will take part in the ceremony
OL,12,Ffor the first time since he became
OL,13,Fmonarch
OL,15,FIt is also the first opening of a
OL,16,FSenedd term since Plaid Cymru became
OL,17,FWales' largest party and took over the
OL,18,Frunning of its government
OL,20,FChants of "not my King" from a small
OL,21,Fgroup of protesters can be heard as the
OL,22,FRoyal car arrives
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
