OL,3,GNEWSAKing Charles says he's 'privileged
OL,4,Aand proud' to have special connection
OL,5,Awith Wales at opening of Senedd
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe King says he feels "immensely
OL,8,Fprivileged and proud to have had such a
OL,9,Fspecial connection with Wales"
OL,11,FWales' national poet has said it is
OL,12,F"quite concerning" that a poem raising
OL,13,Fpolitical issues was rejected from the
OL,14,Fopening ceremony
OL,16,FFollow live updates here, and watch the
OL,17,Fceremony live by clicking play at the
OL,18,Ftop of the page
